  "moving_genes": "trainable (new copies) only (7040); frozen original copies (1440) bit-identical throughout",
  "guard": "true-gap reads on the fixed validation set (10 cities) every 25 updates; best-on-validation weights are the working point; a worse read reverts to the best, resets Adam, and halves the lr (floor 1e-06)",
  "problems": "fresh problems, n = 20 cities, uniform on the unit square, seed stream 20261241 (update u uses batch seed 20261241 + u); never the validation problems"
